    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["Magellan 9300i", "Magellan 9400i"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Magellan 9300i or Magellan 9400i scanner/scale (models 939404 and 939406), Class III, mains operated, self-indicating, weight only, single or dual interval, non-automatic weighing instrument designed for direct sales to the public. Diecast base unit supports the load cell, barcode scanner assembly, main board and analogue boards; the steel L-shaped load receptor is mounted on the four supporting points of the scale sub-assembly. Designed to be flush-mounted in a fixed position in a checkout surface and may be fitted with a level indicator. Legally relevant parameters (scale configuration and calibration) are stored in EEPROM; access to calibration mode only via a switch behind a sealing cap; software version numbers 1-70-28 and 2-0-0. Interfaces: POS terminal (RJ10), remote display (RJ4), scale host (RJ10), auxiliary port (RJ10), EAS port (RJ45), power (Molex 3 pin), USB, image port. Securing by tamper-evident solution bearing a manufacturer's and/or verification officer's mark."
  },
